[144.542406, "o", "e"]
[145.015837, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[145.053031, "o", "Quantization: store each weight in fewer bits. Here fp32 (4 bytes each) -> int8 (1 byte each).\r\n  scale = biggest weight / 127 = 1.50 / 127 = 0.011811\r\n  stored = round(weight / scale), a whole number from -127 to 127\r\n\r\n  word         fp32   int8  int8 x scale     error\r\n  password  +1.4000    119       +1.4055   +0.0055\r\n"]
[145.053221, "o", "  mfa       +1.3000    110       +1.2992   -0.0008\r\n  gift      +1.1000     93       +1.0984   -0.0016\r\n  thanks    -0.6000    -51       -0.6024   -0.0024\r\n  late      -0.3000    -25       -0.2953   +0.0047\r\n\r\n  weights: 172 bytes -> 43 bytes.  Whole file (with header): 384 -> 315 bytes\r\n"]
[145.053857, "o", "  the int8 copy and the fp32 model agree on 40 of 40 eval tickets\r\n\r\nA new file with new bytes: SHA-256 caa0855d7292... -> 2803b6512ddd...\r\nNothing saved. CI makes this same int8 file for every release (toymodel.quantize_int8).\r\n"]
[145.058985, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u001b[00m$ "]
