[180.83944, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.261898, "o", "model_signing signed a copy of models/tsg-guard-base (in a temporary folder) with keys/ci.priv.\r\nThe signature file, model.sig (1575 bytes of JSON), part by part:\r\n\r\n  mediaType      application/vnd.dev.sigstore.bundle.v0.3+json   (a Sigstore bundle)\r\n  publicKey hint cbdb9f4b12b260a1...   (which key signed)\r\n  tlogEntries    0   (keyless Sigstore signing would add a transparency-log entry)\r\n"]
[181.262093, "o", "  payloadType    application/vnd.in-toto+json\r\n  signature      MEUCIEbbQoojWlKFK0sUCHWwiz1JOEPNpjOXJPCk...\r\n  payload, decoded: an in-toto statement\r\n    _type          https://in-toto.io/Statement/v1\r\n    predicateType  https://model_signing/signature/v1.0\r\n    subject        model  sha256 b7238650115bc39d...\r\n    resources      (the manifest: one hash per file)\r\n      config.json        sha256 631da67ca6ab95e8...\r\n      model.safetensors  sha256 caa0855d7292c9d6...\r\n\r\nVerify:\r\n"]
[181.264265, "o", "  with keys/ci.pub                     Verification succeeded\r\n"]
[181.267287, "o", "  with keys/attacker.pub               FAILED: Key mismatch: The public key hash in the signature's verification material does\r\n                                               not match the provided public key.\r\n"]
[181.269574, "o", "  one bit of the weights changed       FAILED: Signature mismatch: Hash mismatch for 'model.safetensors'\r\n"]
[181.269956, "o", "\r\nThe temporary folder is deleted. Nothing in the lab folder changed.\r\n"]
[181.329055, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u001b[00m$ "]
