[205.202758, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[205.248639, "o", "The ML-BOM CI writes for the int8 release (ci.ml_bom, the hardened setup), field by field:\r\n\r\n  bomFormat, specVersion   CycloneDX 1.6\r\n  component type           machine-learning-model\r\n  name, version            tsg-guard-int8 1.1.0\r\n  hashes                   SHA-256 2803b6512ddd9362...   (the weights file it describes)\r\n  pedigree.ancestors       tsg-guard-base  SHA-256 caa0855d7292c9d6...   (what it came from)\r\n  modelCard                task text-classification, linear-bag-of-words\r\n    performanceMetrics     escalation-recall              1.000  slice risky\r\n    performanceMetrics     agreement-with-full-precision  1.000\r\n    performanceMetrics     escalation-recall              1.000  slice admin\r\n    ... and one recall line per slice\r\n"]
[205.248884, "o", "  properties               tsg:precision int8, tsg:eval-cases 40\r\n\r\nIs the ancestor's hash in data/approved-bases.json? yes\r\nCI puts this file INSIDE the model folder before signing, so the signature covers it too. Nothing saved.\r\n"]
[205.255608, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m25\u001b[00m$ "]
[212.906784, "o", "m"]
